    modified_response: "I will now create `/src/components/PlanesPricing.tsx` for core packaging configs (2, 3, 4, and 5-day base training). It lets Admins adjust pricing models cleanly on the fly while restricting Operator profiles (implementing a simulated RLS barrier). It calculates active memberships per plan, estimates theoretical revenue sheets, and records dynamic historical price cards detailing timestamps and the change author\'s email."
