    modified_response: "I will create the `/src/components/MorososControl.tsx` component to handle our automated delinquency control panel (M\303\263dulo 5). It contains high-impact metrics (total debtors, percent of default, and accumulated values) and a list of members in default. More importantly, it features an interactive **Edge Function Simulator**: users can scroll to select a testing date (such as simulating being after the 5th of the month) and trigger our Supabase Cron check. This live-updates database records, outputs step-by-step terminal logging, and offers an action to register payments directly on the spot to clear debts."
