  user_input {
    user_response: "Apply the \"Geometric Balance\" design theme to the app.\n[AIS_METADATA_SECTION_START]\nDesign name: Geometric Balance\nDesign instructions: Extract ONLY the styling (colors, fonts, spacing, borders, shadows, backgrounds, gradients) and layout patterns (flexbox/grid structure, component arrangement) from the Design HTML below. Do NOT replace or restructure the existing app\'s HTML elements \342\200\224 preserve all existing components, content, and functionality. Only modify CSS/styling and adjust layout containers as needed to match the theme\'s aesthetic.\nDesign HTML: <!doctype html>\\n<html style=\\\"height: 100%; margin: 0;\\\">\\n  <head>\\n    <meta charset=\\\"UTF-8\\\" />\\n    <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\\\" />\\n    <script src=\\\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@tailwindcss/browser@4\\\"></script>\\n    <link href=\\\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Material+Symbols+Outlined:opsz,wght,FILL,GRAD@20..48,100..700,0..1,-50..200\\\" rel=\\\"stylesheet\\\" />\\n    <style>\\n      body { margin: 0; height: 100%; display: flex; flex-direction: column; overflow: hidden; }\\n      /* Fallback classes in case Tailwind fails to load in sandbox */\\n      .h-full { height: 100%; }\\n      .w-full { width: 100%; }\\n      .flex { display: flex; }\\n      .flex-col { flex-direction: column; }\\n      .flex-1 { flex: 1 1 0%; }\\n    </style>\\n  </head>\\n  <body>\\n    <style>body{background-color:#f8fafc;margin:0;font-family:\'Inter\',\'Helvetica Neue\',Arial,sans-serif;overflow:hidden}.grid-layout{display:grid;grid-template-columns:240px 1fr;height:768px;width:1024px}.sidebar{background-color:#0f172a;color:#94a3b8;padding:1.5rem;display:flex;flex-column:column}.nav-item{padding:0.75rem 1rem;border-radius:0.5rem;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:0.75rem;margin-bottom:0.25rem;font-size:0.875rem;font-weight:500;transition:all 0.2s}.nav-item.active{background-color:#1e293b;color:#f8fafc}.kpi-card{background:#fff;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;border-radius:0.75rem;padding:1.25rem}.status-pill{padding:2px 8px;border-radius:999px;font-size:10px;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase}.turno-cell{border-bottom:1px solid #f1f5f9;border-right:1px solid #f1f5f9;height:48px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center;padding:0 8px;font-size:11px}</style><div class=\\\"grid-layout\\\"><aside class=\\\"sidebar\\\" style=\\\"flex-direction:column\\\"><div style=\\\"margin-bottom:2rem\\\"><h1 style=\\\"color:#f8fafc;font-size:1.25rem;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-0.025em\\\">APOLO GYM <span style=\\\"color:#38bdf8;font-size:0.75rem;display:block\\\">Administraci\303\263n</span></h1></div><nav><div class=\\\"nav-item active\\\">Dashboard</div><div class=\\\"nav-item\\\">Gesti\303\263n de Socios</div><div class=\\\"nav-item\\\">Grilla de Turnos</div><div class=\\\"nav-item\\\">Control de Pagos</div><div class=\\\"nav-item\\\">Reporte de Mora</div><div class=\\\"nav-item\\\">Planes y Precios</div><div class=\\\"nav-item\\\">Ajustes</div></nav><div style=\\\"margin-top:auto;padding-top:1rem;border-top:1px solid #1e293b\\\"><div style=\\\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:0.75rem\\\"><div style=\\\"width:32px;height:32px;border-radius:50%;background:#38bdf8;display:grid;place-items:center;color:#0f172a;font-weight:700\\\">JR</div><div><p style=\\\"font-size:0.75rem;font-weight:600;color:#f8fafc;margin:0\\\">Juan Rodriguez</p><p style=\\\"font-size:0.625rem;margin:0\\\">Admin Senior</p></div></div></div></aside><main style=\\\"display:flex;flex-direction:column\\\"><header style=\\\"background:#fff;border-bottom:1px solid #e2e8f0;padding:1rem 2rem;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\\\"><h2 style=\\\"font-size:1rem;font-weight:600;color:#1e293b\\\">Panel de Control General</h2><div style=\\\"text-align:right\\\"><p style=\\\"font-size:0.75rem;color:#64748b;margin:0\\\">Buenos Aires, AR | 24 Mayo 2024</p><p style=\\\"font-size:0.875rem;font-weight:700;color:#0f172a;margin:0\\\">10:45 AM</p></div></header><div style=\\\"padding:1.5rem;flex-grow:1;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:1.5rem\\\"><div style=\\\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:1rem\\\"><div class=\\\"kpi-card\\\"><p style=\\\"font-size:0.75rem;color:#64748b;margin-bottom:0.25rem\\\">Socios Activos</p><h3 style=\\\"font-size:1.5rem;font-weight:700;margin:0\\\">142</h3><p style=\\\"font-size:0.625rem;color:#10b981;margin:0\\\">+3.2% vs mes anterior</p></div><div class=\\\"kpi-card\\\"><p style=\\\"font-size:0.75rem;color:#64748b;margin-bottom:0.25rem\\\">Morosidad (D\303\255a 24)</p><h3 style=\\\"font-size:1.5rem;font-weight:700;color:#ef4444;margin:0\\\">$ 142.500</h3><p style=\\\"font-size:0.625rem;color:#64748b;margin:0\\\">12 socios con deuda pendiente</p></div><div class=\\\"kpi-card\\\"><p style=\\\"font-size:0.75rem;color:#64748b;margin-bottom:0.25rem\\\">Cobranza Realizada</p><h3 style=\\\"font-size:1.5rem;font-weight:700;margin:0\\\">78.4%</h3><div style=\\\"height:4px;background:#e2e8f0;border-radius:2px;margin-top:0.5rem\\\"><div style=\\\"height:4px;background:#3b82f6;border-radius:2px;width:78.4%\\\"></div></div></div><div class=\\\"kpi-card\\\"><p style=\\\"font-size:0.75rem;color:#64748b;margin-bottom:0.25rem\\\">Ocupaci\303\263n Turnos</p><h3 style=\\\"font-size:1.5rem;font-weight:700;margin:0\\\">64.2%</h3><p style=\\\"font-size:0.625rem;color:#f59e0b;margin:0\\\">4 turnos en alerta de cupo</p></div></div><div style=\\\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:2fr 1fr;gap:1.5rem;flex-grow:1\\\"><div style=\\\"background:#fff;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;border-radius:0.75rem;overflow:hidden;display:flex;flex-direction:column\\\"><div style=\\\"padding:1rem;border-bottom:1px solid #e2e8f0;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\\\"><h3 style=\\\"font-size:0.875rem;font-weight:600\\\">Grilla Semanal de Turnos (Fijos)</h3><div style=\\\"display:flex;gap:0.5rem\\\"><div style=\\\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:4px;font-size:10px\\\"><span style=\\\"width:8px;height:8px;background:#10b981;border-radius:2px\\\"></span> \303\223ptimo</div><div style=\\\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:4px;font-size:10px\\\"><span style=\\\"width:8px;height:8px;background:#ef4444;border-radius:2px\\\"></span> Lleno</div></div></div><div style=\\\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:60px repeat(5,1fr);flex-grow:1\\\"><div style=\\\"background:#f8fafc;border-right:1px solid #e2e8f0\\\"></div><div style=\\\"text-align:center;padding:8px;font-size:10px;font-weight:700;background:#f8fafc;border-bottom:1px solid #e2e8f0;border-right:1px solid #e2e8f0\\\">LUNES</div><div style=\\\"text-align:center;padding:8px;font-size:10px;font-weight:700;background:#f8fafc;border-bottom:1px solid #e2e8f0;border-right:1px solid #e2e8f0\\\">MARTES</div><div style=\\\"text-align:center;padding:8px;font-size:10px;font-weight:700;background:#f8fafc;border-bottom:1px solid #e2e8f0;border-right:1px solid #e2e8f0\\\">MI\303\211RCOLES</div><div style=\\\"text-align:center;padding:8px;font-size:10px;font-weight:700;background:#f8fafc;border-bottom:1px solid #e2e8f0;border-right:1px solid #e2e8f0\\\">JUEVES</div><div style=\\\"text-align:center;padding:8px;font-size:10px;font-weight:700;background:#f8fafc;border-bottom:1px solid #e2e8f0\\\">VIERNES</div><div style=\\\"text-align:center;font-size:10px;padding-top:15px;color:#64748b\\\">07:30</div><div class=\\\"turno-cell\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#10b981;font-weight:700\\\">4 / 7</span></div><div class=\\\"turno-cell\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#10b981;font-weight:700\\\">3 / 7</span></div><div class=\\\"turno-cell\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#10b981;font-weight:700\\\">5 / 7</span></div><div class=\\\"turno-cell\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#f59e0b;font-weight:700\\\">6 / 7</span></div><div class=\\\"turno-cell\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#10b981;font-weight:700\\\">4 / 7</span></div><div style=\\\"text-align:center;font-size:10px;padding-top:15px;color:#64748b\\\">08:30</div><div class=\\\"turno-cell\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#ef4444;font-weight:700\\\">7 / 7</span></div><div class=\\\"turno-cell\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#10b981;font-weight:700\\\">2 / 7</span></div><div class=\\\"turno-cell\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#f59e0b;font-weight:700\\\">6 / 7</span></div><div class=\\\"turno-cell\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#10b981;font-weight:700\\\">5 / 7</span></div><div class=\\\"turno-cell\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#10b981;font-weight:700\\\">3 / 7</span></div><div style=\\\"text-align:center;font-size:10px;padding-top:15px;color:#64748b\\\">18:00</div><div class=\\\"turno-cell\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#ef4444;font-weight:700\\\">7 / 7</span></div><div class=\\\"turno-cell\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#ef4444;font-weight:700\\\">7 / 7</span></div><div class=\\\"turno-cell\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#f59e0b;font-weight:700\\\">6 / 7</span></div><div class=\\\"turno-cell\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#ef4444;font-weight:700\\\">7 / 7</span></div><div class=\\\"turno-cell\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#ef4444;font-weight:700\\\">7 / 7</span></div><div style=\\\"text-align:center;font-size:10px;padding-top:15px;color:#64748b\\\">19:00</div><div class=\\\"turno-cell\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#ef4444;font-weight:700\\\">7 / 7</span></div><div class=\\\"turno-cell\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#10b981;font-weight:700\\\">5 / 7</span></div><div class=\\\"turno-cell\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#ef4444;font-weight:700\\\">7 / 7</span></div><div class=\\\"turno-cell\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#f59e0b;font-weight:700\\\">6 / 7</span></div><div class=\\\"turno-cell\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#ef4444;font-weight:700\\\">7 / 7</span></div></div></div><div style=\\\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:1rem\\\"><div style=\\\"background:#fff;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;border-radius:0.75rem;padding:1rem;flex-grow:1\\\"><h3 style=\\\"font-size:0.875rem;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:1rem\\\">\303\232ltimos Pagos</h3><div style=\\\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:0.75rem\\\"><div style=\\\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;font-size:0.75rem;padding-bottom:0.5rem;border-bottom:1px solid #f1f5f9\\\"><div><p style=\\\"font-weight:600;margin:0\\\">Garelli, Ricardo</p><p style=\\\"color:#64748b;margin:0\\\">Mercado Pago</p></div><span style=\\\"font-weight:700\\\">$ 22.500</span></div><div style=\\\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;font-size:0.75rem;padding-bottom:0.5rem;border-bottom:1px solid #f1f5f9\\\"><div><p style=\\\"font-weight:600;margin:0\\\">L\303\263pez, Marina</p><p style=\\\"color:#64748b;margin:0\\\">Transferencia</p></div><span style=\\\"font-weight:700\\\">$ 18.000</span></div><div style=\\\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;font-size:0.75rem;padding-bottom:0.5rem;border-bottom:1px solid #f1f5f9\\\"><div><p style=\\\"font-weight:600;margin:0\\\">S\303\241nchez, Diego</p><p style=\\\"color:#64748b;margin:0\\\">Efectivo</p></div><span style=\\\"font-weight:700\\\">$ 22.500</span></div><div style=\\\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;font-size:0.75rem\\\"><div><p style=\\\"font-weight:600;margin:0\\\">P\303\251rez, Valentina</p><p style=\\\"color:#64748b;margin:0\\\">Mercado Pago</p></div><span style=\\\"font-weight:700\\\">$ 18.000</span></div></div></div><div style=\\\"background:#0f172a;color:#fff;border-radius:0.75rem;padding:1rem;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:0.5rem\\\"><h3 style=\\\"font-size:0.75rem;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.05em;color:#94a3b8\\\">Proyecci\303\263n de Ingresos</h3><p style=\\\"font-size:1.25rem;font-weight:700;margin:0\\\">$ 1.250.400 <span style=\\\"font-size:0.75rem;font-weight:400;color:#38bdf8\\\">ARS</span></p><p style=\\\"font-size:0.625rem;color:#94a3b8\\\">Estimado al 100% de ocupaci\303\263n actual.</p></div></div></div></div></main></div>\\n  </body>\\n</html>\n[AIS_METADATA_SECTION_END]"
    items {
      text: "Apply the \"Geometric Balance\" design theme to the app.\n[AIS_METADATA_SECTION_START]\nDesign name: Geometric Balance\nDesign instructions: Extract ONLY the styling (colors, fonts, spacing, borders, shadows, backgrounds, gradients) and layout patterns (flexbox/grid structure, component arrangement) from the Design HTML below. Do NOT replace or restructure the existing app\'s HTML elements \342\200\224 preserve all existing components, content, and functionality. Only modify CSS/styling and adjust layout containers as needed to match the theme\'s aesthetic.\nDesign HTML: <!doctype html>\\n<html style=\\\"height: 100%; margin: 0;\\\">\\n  <head>\\n    <meta charset=\\\"UTF-8\\\" />\\n    <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\\\" />\\n    <script src=\\\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@tailwindcss/browser@4\\\"></script>\\n    <link href=\\\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Material+Symbols+Outlined:opsz,wght,FILL,GRAD@20..48,100..700,0..1,-50..200\\\" rel=\\\"stylesheet\\\" />\\n    <style>\\n      body { margin: 0; height: 100%; display: flex; flex-direction: column; overflow: hidden; }\\n      /* Fallback classes in case Tailwind fails to load in sandbox */\\n      .h-full { height: 100%; }\\n      .w-full { width: 100%; }\\n      .flex { display: flex; }\\n      .flex-col { flex-direction: column; }\\n      .flex-1 { flex: 1 1 0%; }\\n    </style>\\n  </head>\\n  <body>\\n    <style>body{background-color:#f8fafc;margin:0;font-family:\'Inter\',\'Helvetica Neue\',Arial,sans-serif;overflow:hidden}.grid-layout{display:grid;grid-template-columns:240px 1fr;height:768px;width:1024px}.sidebar{background-color:#0f172a;color:#94a3b8;padding:1.5rem;display:flex;flex-column:column}.nav-item{padding:0.75rem 1rem;border-radius:0.5rem;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:0.75rem;margin-bottom:0.25rem;font-size:0.875rem;font-weight:500;transition:all 0.2s}.nav-item.active{background-color:#1e293b;color:#f8fafc}.kpi-card{background:#fff;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;border-radius:0.75rem;padding:1.25rem}.status-pill{padding:2px 8px;border-radius:999px;font-size:10px;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase}.turno-cell{border-bottom:1px solid #f1f5f9;border-right:1px solid #f1f5f9;height:48px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center;padding:0 8px;font-size:11px}</style><div class=\\\"grid-layout\\\"><aside class=\\\"sidebar\\\" style=\\\"flex-direction:column\\\"><div style=\\\"margin-bottom:2rem\\\"><h1 style=\\\"color:#f8fafc;font-size:1.25rem;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-0.025em\\\">APOLO GYM <span style=\\\"color:#38bdf8;font-size:0.75rem;display:block\\\">Administraci\303\263n</span></h1></div><nav><div class=\\\"nav-item active\\\">Dashboard</div><div class=\\\"nav-item\\\">Gesti\303\263n de Socios</div><div class=\\\"nav-item\\\">Grilla de Turnos</div><div class=\\\"nav-item\\\">Control de Pagos</div><div class=\\\"nav-item\\\">Reporte de Mora</div><div class=\\\"nav-item\\\">Planes y Precios</div><div class=\\\"nav-item\\\">Ajustes</div></nav><div style=\\\"margin-top:auto;padding-top:1rem;border-top:1px solid #1e293b\\\"><div style=\\\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:0.75rem\\\"><div style=\\\"width:32px;height:32px;border-radius:50%;background:#38bdf8;display:grid;place-items:center;color:#0f172a;font-weight:700\\\">JR</div><div><p style=\\\"font-size:0.75rem;font-weight:600;color:#f8fafc;margin:0\\\">Juan Rodriguez</p><p style=\\\"font-size:0.625rem;margin:0\\\">Admin Senior</p></div></div></div></aside><main style=\\\"display:flex;flex-direction:column\\\"><header style=\\\"background:#fff;border-bottom:1px solid #e2e8f0;padding:1rem 2rem;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\\\"><h2 style=\\\"font-size:1rem;font-weight:600;color:#1e293b\\\">Panel de Control General</h2><div style=\\\"text-align:right\\\"><p style=\\\"font-size:0.75rem;color:#64748b;margin:0\\\">Buenos Aires, AR | 24 Mayo 2024</p><p style=\\\"font-size:0.875rem;fon